{"id":2284,"slug":"used-by-form","title":"Used By &#8211; Submission Form","date":"2015-03-21T09:56:55","url":"https://www.kamailio.org/w/used-by-form/","html":"<p>Add a new record to <a href=\"https://www.kamailio.org/w/used-by/\">Used-By directory</a>, which is listing where and how Kamailio is used.</p>\n<p><span style=\"color: #808080;\"><em><span style=\"color: #808080;\">Note that only first 160 characters from description are displayed. It is recommended to add a logo image for nicer display of the entry, the recommended width is 150px, larger ones are cropped</span>.</em></span></p>\n<div class=\"strong-view strong-form strong-view-id-2 default-form wpmtst-default-form\" data-state=\"idle\">\n<div class=\"strong-form-wait\" data-formid=\"1\">\n<div class=\"message\"><img decoding=\"async\" src=\"https://www.kamailio.org/w/wp-content/plugins/strong-testimonials/assets/public/svg/spinner-solid.svg\" alt=\"Strong Testimonials form submission spinner.\"></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"wpmtst-form wpmtst-form-id-1\">\n<div class=\"strong-form-inner\">\n<p class=\"required-notice\"><span class=\"required symbol\"></span>Required field\t\t</p>\n<form class=\"wpmtst-submission-form\" method=\"post\" enctype=\"multipart/form-data\" autocomplete=\"off\" data-config=\"{&quot;scroll&quot;:{&quot;onError&quot;:true,&quot;onErrorOffset&quot;:40,&quot;onSuccess&quot;:true,&quot;onSuccessOffset&quot;:40},&quot;fields&quot;:[{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;post_title&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;required&quot;:1},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;company_name&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;text&quot;,&quot;required&quot;:1},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;company_website&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;url&quot;,&quot;required&quot;:1},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;post_content&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;textarea&quot;,&quot;required&quot;:1},{&quot;name&quot;:&quot;featured_image&quot;,&quot;type&quot;:&quot;file&quot;,&quot;required&quot;:0}],&quot;nonceUrl&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.kamailio.org\\/w\\/wp-admin\\/admin-ajax.php&quot;,&quot;ajaxUrl&quot;:&quot;https:\\/\\/www.kamailio.org\\/w\\/wp-admin\\/admin-ajax.php&quot;}\" data-formid = \"1\">\n<div style=\"display: none;\"><input type=\"hidden\" id=\"wpmtst_form_nonce\" name=\"wpmtst_form_nonce\" value=\"6b4e594d50\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"_wp_http_referer\" value=\"/w/wp-json/wp/v2/pages?per_page=100&#038;page=1\" /><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"action\" value=\"wpmtst_form\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"form_id\" value=\"1\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"default_category\" value=\"141\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"view_id\" value=\"2\"><input type=\"hidden\" name=\"category\" value=\"141\"></div>\n<div class=\"form-field field-post_title\"><label for=\"wpmtst_post_title\" class=\"field-post_title\">Title</label><span class=\"required symbol\"></span><input id=\"wpmtst_post_title\" type=\"text\" class=\"text\" name=\"post_title\"  value=\"\" placeholder=\"\"   required tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"after\">Name of the product, service or company</span></div>\n<div class=\"form-field field-company_name\"><label for=\"wpmtst_company_name\" class=\"field-company_name\">Company Name</label><span class=\"required symbol\"></span><input id=\"wpmtst_company_name\" type=\"text\" class=\"text\" name=\"company_name\"  value=\"\" placeholder=\"\"   required tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"after\">Name of the entity owning the product or the service</span></div>\n<div class=\"form-field field-company_website\"><label for=\"wpmtst_company_website\" class=\"field-company_website\">Website</label><span class=\"required symbol\"></span><input id=\"wpmtst_company_website\" type=\"url\" class=\"text url\" name=\"company_website\"  value=\"\" placeholder=\"\"   required tabindex=\"0\"><span class=\"after\">Link to the website of the company, product or service</span></div>\n<div class=\"form-field field-post_content\"><label for=\"wpmtst_post_content\" class=\"field-post_content\">Description</label><span class=\"required symbol\"></span><textarea id=\"wpmtst_post_content\" name=\"post_content\" class=\"textarea\"  required placeholder=\"\"  tabindex=\"0\"></textarea><span class=\"after\">Short description</span></div>\n<div class=\"form-field field-featured_image\"><label for=\"wpmtst_featured_image\" class=\"field-featured_image\">Logo</label></p>\n<div class=\"field-wrap\"><input id=\"wpmtst_featured_image\" type=\"file\" name=\"featured_image\" accept=\"image/*\" tabindex=\"0\"></div>\n<p><span class=\"after\">Logo image (png, jpg, gif) - 150x60px</span></div>\n<div class=\"form-field wpmtst-submit\"><label><input type=\"submit\" class=\"wpmtst_submit_testimonial button\" name=\"wpmtst_submit_testimonial\" value=\"Add Testimonial\" tabindex=\"0\"></label></div>\n</form>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n","excerpt":"<p>Add a new record to Used-By directory, which is listing where and how Kamailio is used. Note that only first 160 characters from description are displayed. It is recommended to add a<a class=\"moretag\" href=\"https://www.kamailio.org/w/used-by-form/\">Read More&#8230;</a></p>\n","type":"page"}